#Description: 
##This table contains data for a large superstore. Inventory information, item ratings and names are included within the table.

#Business Task:
##The Superstore has a new owner and the inventory needs to be organized. To do so, items will be ordered by price, aggregate data will be gathered for the item categories, such as average sales price per category, best sellers, and general inventory will be queried.

#Sources:
##Dataset provided through Break into Tech Data Analytics Certificate Course.

#Tools:
##DB-Fiddle - create tables and run SQL queries 

#Data Cleaning and Preparation:
##Table created utilizing provided data.

**Schema (MySQL v5.7)**

    CREATE TABLE superstore (
        item_id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY,
        item_name TEXT,
        category TEXT,
        price DECIMAL(10, 2),
        stock_quantity INTEGER,
        average_rating DECIMAL(3, 2)
    );
    
